* LTC6252 High-Speed Amplifier configured for a gain of 2 V/V
Vin IN 0 SINE(0 1 10Meg)
VCC VCC 0 5
VEE VEE 0 -5

* LTC6252 Op-Amp Instance (IN+, IN-, V+, V-, OUT)
X1 IN V_minus VCC VEE OUT LTC6252

* Non-inverting feedback network (Gain = 1 + Rf/Rg = 2)
Rf OUT V_minus 499
Rg V_minus 0 499

* Transient analysis: run to 2us, saving data from 1.5us to 2us (5 cycles at 10MHz)
* Maximum time step set to 1ns for high resolution
.tran 0 2u 1.5u 1n

* Measure peak-to-peak voltages and calculate gain in dB
.meas tran out_pp PP V(OUT)
.meas tran in_pp PP V(IN)
.meas tran gain_db PARAM 20*log10(out_pp/in_pp)

.end
